Package: aegisgate-rampart
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Version: 0.6.0
Depends: ca-certificates
Maintainer: AegisGate Security <security@aegisgatesecurity.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/aegisgatesecurity/aegisgate-rampart
Description: Local AI security proxy for intercepting and detecting threats
 AegisGate Rampart is a local HTTPS MITM proxy that intercepts traffic
 to AI API endpoints and runs real-time detection for PII, secrets, XSS,
 and compliance violations. It can actively block threats before they
 reach the AI service. Privacy-first with no telemetry by default.
